// Sharpened altitude/speed reward scales for tight steady-state tracking
// (goal: mean_tail_abs_altitude_m <= 0.2 m, mean_tail_abs_speed_mps <= 0.2 m/s,
// i.e. error over the settled final 20% of each episode — see
// evaluate_policy's --task level_hold output).
//
// Produced by target/skill-runs/level_hold-goal-20260804-110004 (a 3-batch,
// up-to-6-parallel train_ppo search over reward/PPO variants starting from
// the promoted skill_level_hold_clip_entropy_combo_b3 incumbent). Winning
// checkpoint: models/level_hold/skill_level_hold_goal_cont_scratchlong_a60s6_b3.mpk
// — reached mean_tail_abs_altitude_m=0.113 m, mean_tail_abs_speed_mps=0.193 m/s,
// success_rate=1.0 over 300 eval episodes.
//
// Key finding: warm-starting from the (looser-reward) incumbent under this
// tighter reward performed worse than training from scratch under it, and
// best results came from a 3-stage curriculum — scratch under a loose-tight
// reward (alt_scale=80, speed_scale=15) for 2M steps, continue under a
// medium-tight reward (alt_scale=80, speed_scale=8) for 3M steps, continue
// again under this config (alt_scale=60, speed_scale=6) for 1.5M steps —
// rather than jumping straight to tight scales from scratch or from the
// original incumbent. Not the default level_hold reward config — this
// profile trades a much larger (more negative) mean_return magnitude for
// tighter physical tracking error; pass explicitly via
// --reward-config assets/training/level_hold_tight_tracking.reward.ron.
//
// NOTE: the checkpoint and eval numbers above were all measured at a single fixed
// 1000 m / 100 m/s target, before target altitude/airspeed were randomized per-episode
// (LevelHoldEnv::with_target_ranges, default 500-5000 m / 90-140 m/s). A randomized-target
// run is a harder task and is not expected to reach the same tail-error numbers without
// its own retune.
(
    alt_error_scale:    60.0,
    alt_error_weight:   1.0,
    speed_error_scale:  6.0,
    speed_error_weight: 0.5,
    roll_scale:         0.5,
    roll_weight:        0.3,
    beta_scale:         0.5,
    beta_weight:        0.1,
    alive_bonus:        0.01,
    min_altitude:       10.0,
    max_altitude_error: 500.0,
    max_episode_steps:  3200,
)
